  "local_policies": [
    "Capture original current physical deck SPELL references, current local costs and all requests in original deck order before delivering any transformations. Old hand cards, minions and later additions are excluded.",
    "Use collectible spells from all classes in the fixed ordinary host pool. Each original local cost maps to min(10, cost+3); the replacement retains that original local cost through the existing transformation CostSpec.",
    "Historical community reports support current discounted deck costs and a ten-mana tier cap. Values above ten, exact tier gaps and precise CN timing remain uncalibrated. An actually empty tier uses the existing explicit skip policy; unknown eligible definitions error and are never pruned.",
    "The current stored-card reference determines departure/reentry; stale targets skip. New random spell bodies and later hand/deck movement retain/reset material according to existing lifecycle policies."
  ]
